  "html": "<section id=\"cw-layout-atlas\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #fffaf5; border-top: 5px solid #98501d; box-sizing: border-box; color: #403329; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 18px; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; padding-top: 0; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><section style=\"background-color: rgb(64, 51, 41); box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; max-width: 100%; padding: 24px 20px 20px; text-align: left; width: 100%;\" data-no-dark=\"\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; width: 100%;\" data-no-dark=\"\">开场第一段：比赛结束后，人们先看到了比分。阅读一篇文章，也需要先交代背景，让读者知道事情从哪里开始。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 0 0; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&amp;v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"></p></section><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\">开场第二段：比分接近，真正需要讨论的是关键时刻的判断。连续的正文应留在同一个阅读容器里，左右都应有清楚的留白。</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\">开场第三段：接下来再进入具体章节。段落数量改变时，不应丢失内容，不应贴边，也不应为每段重复一层巨大的卡片内边距。</p><section style=\"margin: 24px 0 24px; margin-bottom: 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"><section style=\"background-color: #f6eadb; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 18px 16px; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-top: 16px; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><h2 style=\"color: #403329; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; padding: 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\" data-no-dark=\"\">从标题开始，建立阅读节奏</h2></section><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 12px 0 0; padding-bottom: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\">标题需要一个清楚的重心。<strong style=\"font-weight: 700\" data-no-dark=\"\">重点句只强调一次</strong>，其余正文让段落长度、行距和留白承担节奏。</p><blockquote style=\"border: 1px solid #e2cab9; color: #403329; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 0 20px; padding: 12px 16px 12px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><p style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\" data-no-dark=\"\">排版的任务，是把内容的关系呈现出来。</p></blockquote><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 16px; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\">每种风格都应该有自己的声音，同时让正文保持完整、清楚和可读。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 24px 0 24px; margin-bottom: 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"><section style=\"background-color: #f6eadb; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 18px 16px; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-top: 16px; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><h2 style=\"color: #403329; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; padding: 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\" data-no-dark=\"\">三个可以马上检查的地方</h2></section><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 12px 0 0; padding-bottom: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><ul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\" data-no-dark=\"\"><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\">标题是否有独立的视觉重心</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\">章节之间是否留出呼吸空间</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\">重点是否与普通正文形成清楚层级</li></ul><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 20px 0 20px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><p style=\"background-color: #f6eadb; box-sizing: border-box; color: #403329; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 0; padding: 6px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&amp;v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"></p></section><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 20px 0 20px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><p style=\"background-color: #f6eadb; box-sizing: border-box; color: #403329; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 0; padding: 6px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&amp;v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"></p></section><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; margin: 20px 0 20px; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><thead data-no-dark=\"\"><tr data-no-dark=\"\"><th style=\"background-color: #98501d; border: 1px solid #e2cab9; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">检查项</th><th style=\"background-color: #98501d; border: 1px solid #e2cab9; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: